      "content": "but what if the darkness isn't just a state? what if it's just who i am now? i feel like i've become this... this stain. like no matter how much i try to \"grow,\" the damage is already done and i'm just carrying it around, hurting everyone who tries to get close to me. it feels like the only way to actually stop being a burden, to actually stop the harm, would be to just... stop existing. does that even make sense? like, is there any version of this where my absence is actually a better thing for the world than my presence?",
